&quot;. You can challenge your own survival limit and survive as long as possible. At the same time, the game also provides two clearance methods: &quot;normal clearance&quot; and &quot;perfect clearance&quot;. On the basis of survival, you need to do more to save those survivors.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543120/extras/5e26b024dc11a5960d9f99526f0d3bbf.webp?t=1753155302\" width=615 height=40 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543120/extras/764d8c634472ed4d03c0ba2a821a04c4.avif?t=1753155302\" width=614 height=180 /></span><br>We tried to make a game that can be quickly started and worth playing repeatedly through a simple method and lightweight scale. We have tried our best to enrich the strategy combinations with limited functions and content, and introduced a certain random mechanism to increase the uncertainty of the game.<br>Maybe we haven't done it well enough, but we hope it can bring you some different game fun~",
